    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spectacularly situated 4 bed contemporary residence with detached studio and garage  and well maintained garden all on c. 4.5 acre coastal plot. Featuring panoramic south westerly sea views, a quality interior and sheltered paddocks the property is in excellent condition throughout. Discreetly located just off the main Schull to Goleen road and within close proximity of the beautiful Ballyrisode beach.\r\nServices: Oil fired central heating, well water, private drainage, broadband"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Sun Room - 6.5m x 2.8m \r\nOak floor, Luxaflex blinds, open to sitting room, glass sliding doors to south and west facing patio, panoramic sea and coastal views\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 6.0m x 5.1m \r\nOak floor, cast iron fireplace, panoramic sea and coastal views\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - 8.4m x 5.0m \r\nOak floor, wooden kitchen with granite worktop, breakfast bar, American fridge freezer, electric double oven and integrated microwave, hob and extractor, integrated dishwasher, glass door to south and west facing patio, panoramic sea and coastal views\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.2m x 2.6m \r\nTiled floor, kitchen units, sink unit, washing machine, dryer\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 5.8m x 3.6m \r\nOak floor, built in wardrobe, panoramic sea and coastal views, full ensuite\r\n\r\nWashroom - 2.5m x 1.8m \r\nTiled, wash hand basin, w.c.\r\n\r\nLanding - 2.4m x 2.0m \r\nWooden floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.8m x 4.8m \r\nWooden floor, feature window offering panoramic sea and coastal views, walk in dressing room, full ensuite\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 5.4m x 4.8m \r\nPanoramic sea and coastal views, built in wardrobe, full ensuite\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 4.1m x 3.6m \r\nBuilt in wardrobe, full ensuite and bath\r\n\r\nStudio - 5.0m x 4.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nGarage - 7.7m x 4.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nPolytunnel - 9.7m x 4.2m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
